{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1399520-need-help-brainstorming-famous-dead-virtuous-people-for-chronicle","id":1399520,"title":"Need help Brainstorming Famous Dead Virtuous People for Chronicle","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-27T23:47:43-07:00","id":1399520,"title":"Need help Brainstorming Famous Dead Virtuous People for Chronicle","content":"Hello!<br /> <br /> I am introducing a mechanic within my chronicle that allows the resurrection of virtuous people whom meet these prerequisites at the time of their death:<ul><li>Was without a Template when they died (no one who was likely a Mage, Ghoul, ect...)</li> <li>Had Integrity 8 or higher</li> <li>Had the Virtuous Merit</li> </ul><br /> I am wondering among the Chronicles of Darkness versions of themselves, whom are some real life famous dead people that would qualify? Like starting with the most obvious and working to the most obscure.<br /> <br /> As a counter thought, among the Chronicles of Darkness versions of themselves, whom are some real life famous dead people that would be statted with Vice-Ridden and an Integrity under 3?<br /> <br /> Please no one currently alive.<br /> <br /> Some ideas which come to my mind:<ul><li>13th and older incarnations of the Dalai Lama</li> <li>Gandhi</li> <li>Mother Teresa</li> <li>Martin Luther</li> <li>Ooodles of Martyred Saints (unless some had Templates)</li> <li>Fred Rogers</li> <li>Bob Ross</li> <li>Steve Irwin</li> <li>Jane Goodall</li> </ul><br /> <br /> As for the Vice-Ridden low Integrity List (unless some had Templates)<ul><li>Mao Zedong</li> <li>Joseph Stalin</li> <li>Adolf Hilter</li> <li>Marquis de Sade</li> <li>Josef Mengele</li> <li>Elizabeth B\u00e1thory</li> <li>Judas Iscariot</li> </ul><br /> Anyway, I am not great at this which is why I was asking for help brainstorming and thought it'd be a fun mental and social exercise for others as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 06-28-2020, 02:51 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T03:10:58-07:00","id":1399546,"title":"","content":"Gamefying people in recent memory can run the borders of good taste, to be frank. Especially in individuals like Mengele.<br /> <br /> You might want to restrict it to people who were the 19th century or before.<br /> <br /> Except for David Bowie, who was an avatar of the Unconquered Sun.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T09:39:39-07:00","id":1399610,"title":"","content":"Harriet Tubman? (Underground Railroad)<br /> <br /> Susan B Anthony<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\">[COLOR=rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)]<span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Oskar Schindler<br /> <br /> Are they able to pick their target? Or could you make someone up, or someone history knows, but the players/characters don't?<br /> <br /> Or what if it could work on a fictional character? Samwise Gamgee maybe?</span>[/COLOR]</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24473-willowfang","name":"Willowfang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24473_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T13:12:09-07:00","id":1399645,"title":"","content":"<ul><li>By the way, isn't Jane Goodall still alive?</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25493-mr-scissors","name":"Mr.Scissors","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T14:33:54-07:00","id":1399671,"title":"","content":"This just comes to me because of a video series I watched recently but the Korean hero 'Admiral Yi' is sometimes called one of the most loyal men who ever lived so that's a potential candidate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T14:45:49-07:00","id":1399676,"title":"","content":"I think there's an issue with the virtue/vice and integrity system not easily mapping onto morality.<br /> <br /> Like, vice/virtue are pretty clearly mapped to the individual's perspective.<br /> <br /